<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cenbank calls for repo bids at unch 3 pct.</title>
<headline>Austria cenbank calls for repo bids at unch 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Thursday it was calling for bids on two-week securities repurchase agreements at a fixed rate of 3.0 percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>Bids have to be in by 0800 GMT on Friday, it said.</p>
<p>Last week, the central bank allotted 13.7 billion schillings in repos, filling 11 percent of bids. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
